<p>[Edit a couple days later:]</p>
<p>I couldn&#8217;t help myself, and checked what results OpenAI and Gemini gave me.  <a href="https://github.com/HaoooWang/llm-knowledge-cutoff-dates" data-cached-time="2025-04-20T18:53:49" data-cached-image="https://lars.ingebrigtsen.no/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/cache-2025-04-20-web-scaled.webp" onmouseenter="hoverLink(event)">Of course they can&#8217;t tell me about &#8220;what&#8217;s new&#8221;</a> because they don&#8217;t get &#8220;knowledge updates&#8221; very often, but I can ask them for missing books, for instance.  Let&#8217;s do David Sedaris as an example again, and the query is basically &#8220;list all books by David Sedaris, but exclude books from this list:&#8221;, and then the list of the books I already have.</p>
<p><a class=cimage href="https://lars.ingebrigtsen.no/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2025-04-20.jpeg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://lars.ingebrigtsen.no/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2025-04-20.jpeg" alt="" width="840" height="149" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-112329" srcset="https://lars.ingebrigtsen.no/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2025-04-20.jpeg 1352w, https://lars.ingebrigtsen.no/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2025-04-20-300x53.jpeg 300w, https://lars.ingebrigtsen.no/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2025-04-20-1024x183.jpeg 1024w, https://lars.ingebrigtsen.no/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2025-04-20-768x137.jpeg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 840px) 100vw, 840px" /></a></p>
<p>Here&#8217;s Perplexity (sonar-pro).</p>
<p><a class=cimage href="https://lars.ingebrigtsen.no/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2025-04-20-1.jpeg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://lars.ingebrigtsen.no/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2025-04-20-1.jpeg" alt="" width="840" height="154" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-112330" srcset="https://lars.ingebrigtsen.no/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2025-04-20-1.jpeg 1111w, https://lars.ingebrigtsen.no/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2025-04-20-1-300x55.jpeg 300w, https://lars.ingebrigtsen.no/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2025-04-20-1-1024x188.jpeg 1024w, https://lars.ingebrigtsen.no/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2025-04-20-1-768x141.jpeg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 840px) 100vw, 840px" /></a></p>
